  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of the 17th-Century Church of the Assumption in Causeni, Phases 2-3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Built in the mid-17th century and decorated on the interior with 18th-century murals, the Assumption of the Virgin Mary Church is one of the oldest extant churches in Moldova. This project, which completes work begun under a previous Ambassadors Fund grant, directly supports the U.S. embassys efforts to provide the Moldovan community in eastern Moldova with a platform for discussing the importance of preserving its own heritage and identity in an ethnically diverse society.</narrative>
  </description>
